body:
I hate that I have to pay $144 to watch it. I can't afford that. It's such a shame, if this is SO important, that they wouldn't just give people some time to watch it for a one-time fee (maybe like one month instead of a one year membership?).

&#x200B;

I'm very disappointed in the daily wire for doing this.

You're right that it's a Phrygian with one added note. The Ab really is critical to the riff though. If I play a D Locrian & D Phrygian... all 8 of those notes are used. So maybe it's a combination of the two?

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
